# Copy to `worker/.dev.vars` (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev` / `make worker-dev`.
# Only needed if you hit the /api/auth/* routes locally.
#
# Production sets this as a real secret: `wrangler secret put SESSION_SIGNING_KEY`.
# Tests use the value in vitest.workers.config.ts.
SESSION_SIGNING_KEY=dev-only-not-a-secret

# Push notifications (FEATURE_BACKLOG.md) — all optional; apnsConfigFromEnv()
# is a no-op until every one of APNS_KEY_ID/APNS_TEAM_ID/APNS_PRIVATE_KEY/
# APNS_TOPIC is set (NEXT_STEPS.md Phase 6's owner action: enable Push
# Notifications on the App ID, generate a .p8 Auth Key in the Apple Developer
# portal). Production sets these as real secrets (`wrangler secret put ...`);
# APNS_PRIVATE_KEY is the whole .p8 file's contents, literal newlines and all.
# APNS_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox for an Xcode debug build's device tokens
# (unset/anything else = production, for TestFlight/App Store builds).
# APNS_KEY_ID=
# APNS_TEAM_ID=
# APNS_PRIVATE_KEY=
# APNS_TOPIC=com.clantab.app
# APNS_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
